t.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Delasport_Testimonials_Svetlana-300x293.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px" /><div id="div_block-1275-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><h3 id="headline-1276-14377" class="ct-headline gradientText">Svetlana Damianova <br></h3><div id="text_block-1277-14377" class="ct-text-block" >Quality Assurance Team Lead </div><div id="text_block-1278-14377" class="ct-text-block" >“Our team is extremely close-knit and positive. We are more than colleagues; we are true friends. We are one big family!”   </div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div id="slide-1416-14377" class="ct-slide" ><div id="new_columns-1417-14377" class="ct-new-columns" ><div id="div_block-1418-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><img  id="image-1419-14377" alt="" src="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Dana.png" class="ct-image" srcset="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Dana.png 408w, https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Dana-300x293.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px" /><div id="div_block-1420-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><h3 id="headline-1421-14377" class="ct-headline gradientText">Dana Nestorova<br></h3><div id="text_block-1422-14377" class="ct-text-block" >Delivery &amp; Scrum Manager</div><div id="text_block-1423-14377" class="ct-text-block" >“I come to work every day motivated and inspired because I have the chance to work with an amazing team of professionals. Delasport allowed me to find my perfect career path and have given me the opportunity to grow. I consider my time at Delasport to be a journey, and I'm sure the best is yet to come.“</div></div></div><div id="div_block-1424-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><img  id="image-1425-14377" alt="" src="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Marin.png" class="ct-image" srcset="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Marin.png 408w, https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delasport_Testimonials_Marin-300x293.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px" /><div id="div_block-1426-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><h3 id="headline-1427-14377" class="ct-headline gradientText">Marin Terziyski<br></h3><div id="text_block-1428-14377" class="ct-text-block" >Head of Front-End</div><div id="text_block-1429-14377" class="ct-text-block" >“Delasport is a company that gives me a lot of opportunities and freedom. My teammates make my working environment so nice and comfortable, so I don't think of my work as a normal job: more like a hobby. They say time flies when you’re having fun, and this is certainly true for my time at Delasport.”   </div></div></div></div></div></li><li><div id="slide-1430-14377" class="ct-slide" ><div id="new_columns-1431-14377" class="ct-new-columns" ><div id="div_block-1432-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><img  id="image-1433-14377" alt="" src="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Delasport_Testimonials_Jay.png" class="ct-image" srcset="https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Delasport_Testimonials_Jay.png 408w, https://www.delasport.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Delasport_Testimonials_Jay-300x293.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px" /><div id="div_block-1434-14377" class="ct-div-block" ><h3 id="headline-1435-14377" class="ct-headline gradientText">Jay Duhaylongsod<br></h3><div id="text_block-1436-14377" class="ct-text-block" >Head of Finance</div><div id="text_block-1437-14377" class="ct-text-block" >“Throughout my career in tech and gaming, I’ve experienced many company cultures, but Delasport truly stands out for its respect for diversity and strong sense of community. Leading the Finance team here means working with talented people across the business, turning great ideas into measurable results while maintaining a healthy balance between performance and well-being.“</div></div></div><div id="div_block-1438-14377